    "- `route_geom...`: finds and creates a unioned (combined) geometry of the route\n",
    "- `return {\"distance\": sum(edge_lengths) / 1609.34, \"route_geom\": route_geom}` returns a dictionary of distance (in miles) and the route geometry\n"
   ]
